{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》第6集，保安室面臨紀律大危機之際卻遇上神智不清孫婆婆大鬧尋找「乖孫」。保安團隊為 …</p><p></p>\n<p>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》第6集，保安室面臨紀律大危機之際卻遇上神智不清孫婆婆大鬧尋找「乖孫」。保安團隊為維護住客利益展開全城尋孫大行動，沒想到這位神祕「乖孫」真實身分竟然與屯門兆康苑拯救事件息息相關！</p>\n<h2>李寶安整頓軍紀遇孫婆婆</h2>\n<p>劇情講述保安室紀律每況愈下，各人以輸馬、煲碟及生飛滋等理由遲到，主角李寶安決心重整軍紀。就在此時，鬼馬又時而糊塗孫婆婆突然大鬧保安室，並當場錯認麥峰為親生兒子，強烈要求對方協助尋找失散「孫仔」。為了維護住客利益及平息風波，一眾保安員唯有各顯神通，硬著頭皮展開尋找乖孫大行動，從而在尋找過程中揭開一段真實動物棄養悲歌。</p>\n<h2>導演何爵天邀救援機構「龜途」合作</h2>\n<p>面對這次破格劇本設定，導演何爵天特別邀請動物救援機構「龜途」合作參與拍攝。機構其後在社交平台發文致謝，透露這次出鏡小小演員其實是一隻曾在屯門兆康苑獲救反甲巴西龜。機構在聲明中表示：「好感謝何爵天導演的邀請，參與《你的保安李寶安》第6集拍攝！」他們提到以往常見處境劇植入式廣告，這次卻成功在劇中植入愛護動物訊息。</p>\n<h2>顧問邦Sir即場示範正確抱龜姿勢</h2>\n<p>這次跨界合作並非單純借用動物作為拍攝道具，動物救援機構顧問邦Sir親自帶領反甲龜到場，並以顧問身份在現場分享這隻巴西龜背後驚險拯救故事。為了配合劇情需要，邦Sir親自向演員示範如何正確拿起龜隻，全程將動物健康放在首位。機構特別感謝劇組植入「愛護動物、尊重生命、無分種類」這項重要訊息。</p>\n<h2>網民讚棄養劇情具意義 大讚龜龜演技</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，大批觀眾紛紛留言發表觀後感。有網民笑言「話時話啲龜都好識做戲」。同時也有不少人被劇情觸動，留言表示「第6集嘅劇情溫馨又感動，提出棄養動物」、「今集好有情同教育意義，讚」、「幾好睇，算有貼地嘅」。網上討論區充斥關於棄養動物議題各項討論。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371475674758725_17556615716ae9ea452a3e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-861EP6XWalletHOY-YouTube-19’03”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371475674758725_17556615716ae9ea452a3e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》第6集，保安室面臨紀律大危機之際卻遇上神智不清孫婆婆大鬧尋找「乖孫」。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371534880817194_12358465136ae9ec951930f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371534880817194_12358465136ae9ec951930f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>為了維護住客利益及平息風波，一眾保安員唯有各顯神通，硬著頭皮展開尋找乖孫大行動。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535255496328_3762855906ae9ec98d1a39.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535255496328_3762855906ae9ec98d1a39.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民笑言「話時話啲龜都好識做戲」。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535709155916_8507581766ae9ec9d75e2e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535709155916_8507581766ae9ec9d75e2e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>動物救援機構顧問邦Sir親自帶領反甲龜到場，並以顧問身份在現場分享這隻巴西龜背後驚險拯救故事。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536112416190_12968692356ae9eca16a299.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536112416190_12968692356ae9eca16a299.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536490136260_17833005226ae9eca527326.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536490136260_17833005226ae9eca527326.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536903681426_4019371536ae9eca9609a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536903681426_4019371536ae9eca9609a2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%a0%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%9d%e5%ae%89%e6%9d%8e%e5%af%b6%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你的保安李寶安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8b%95%e7%89%a9%e6%a3%84%e9%a4%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">動物棄養</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e6%b0%91%e7%86%b1%e8%ad%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網民熱議</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535404\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:33.950513+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1352,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:16:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:48.489175+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:48.489175+00:00","content_hash":"07c51e382669fcceb788e686a15879b986daf3d169b5458c8d47f0a42eefdf7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}